.TH AVR\-ORG\-SAML\-TEST 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-saml-test \- Test the SAML connection in a browser (admin only).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org saml test
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Test the SAML connection in a browser (admin only).
.PP
The test performs a real IdP sign-in and displays the parsed assertion without creating a new Avrea session.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr org saml test
    avr org saml test --org acme --no-browser
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-browser\fR
Print the test URL without opening a browser.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-saml (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-configure (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-enforcement (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-remove (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-show (1),
.BR avr-org-saml-sp-metadata (1)
